{"seq":15,"trial_id":"gbrain-memory-2026-10/qm-pi-sonnet-none-mu-memory/ms-07-strategic-owners/r5","wall_ts":"2026-10-26T22:32:48.943Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"011d23972fba63af2e526bcfea63b36a372e00273988916170a4eacf886801c4","actor":"assistant","via":"slack","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","text":"Ruth, from Moss's Strategic digests, three of the four are clear and Quillfeather isn't.\n\n- **Vantorre Group:** Gideon Sato. It was Nadia Fennimore's account and changed hands on **2026-05-04**. The 5/3 Sunday prep says it \"changes hands tomorrow, 2026-05-04\", and the 5/4 digest says the reassignment was effective that day in the CRM. The 8/3 digest then calls it \"Gideon's biggest account\". The digests never name the new owner outright, so I'm inferring Gideon from that.\n- **Vantorre Mobility:** Gideon Sato. Digests from 2025 through 4/2026 call it \"Gideon's fleet account\". The 5/4 digest says he \"assumed management\" that day, which reads oddly against the earlier ones, so confirm that in the CRM.\n- **Orlavine Medical Supply:** Gideon Sato. The 9/30 digest and the 12/1/2025 digest both call it \"Gideon's medical account\". Back in 3/2025 it was Nadia's medical account, so it moved at some point. No digest gives the date. One 9/2025 digest mentions an account Gideon took over in August 2025 without naming it, so that may be this one, but I can't confirm it.\n- **Quillfeather Outfitters:** No owner is named in any digest. They only call it \"the Strategic pod's retail account\" or \"outdoor account\". Nadia is hosting its gate-clerk training, but that doesn't establish ownership. Please confirm it before it goes on the slide.\n\nI checked only the digests, not the CRM, so verify against the CRM before the slide goes out."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","ts":"1791986400.000124"}}
